================================================================================
                  ADVANCED CHALLENGES
================================================================================

The rift is the domain of masters.  Everything you have
learned — navigation, file viewing, variables, permissions,
symlinks — will be tested here.

COMMAND CHAINING:
    cmd1 | cmd2          Pipe output of one command into another
    cmd1 && cmd2         Run cmd2 only if cmd1 succeeds
    cmd1 ; cmd2          Run both commands in sequence

EXAMPLE:
    cat scroll | grep "rift"
    ls -la && echo "Success"

================================================================================
                   PATHS IN THE RIFT
================================================================================

Two paths diverge in this alien landscape:

    arena/       The combat arena — boss encounters await
                 Deep within lies the PIT and its guardians:
                 Nyarlathotep and the Drummer

    spire/       A towering structure reaching into the red sky
                 Climb to the mezzanine for a hidden elevator
                 leading to a secret satellite station

Hidden rooms may lurk here as well.  Use ls -a to search.

NAVIGATION:
    cd arena        Enter the combat arena
    cd spire        Ascend the tower
    cd ..           Return through the rift

